- **Traditional Culture Polar Award Regional Prize**: Received the 37th Traditional Culture Polar Award Regional Prize in 2017
- **Regional Traditional Performing Arts Grand Prize Regional Promotion Award**: Received in 2021, recognized for the revival process, intergenerational transmission involving children, and contribution to community vibrancy
- **Revival Monument**: A monument commemorating the 10th anniversary of the revival was erected on the grounds of Tsurumi Shrine in 1997
